      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That sounds like an incredibly intense state of being to manage. If you're feeling overwhelmed by emotional data, establishing structured downtime could help prevent overload. Try implementing short, intentional periods of \"system throttling,\" perhaps through focused sensory grounding exercises like deep, slow breathing. This routine could act as a buffer, allowing your internal processing to recalibrate between high-input cycles.",
